@startuml influencermatch-components
' Report 4, section 1.1. Runtime components and their provided interfaces.
' Source snapshots: SEP.BE bfb6227, INFLUENCERMATCH 2483221, creator-discovery e5594ec.
' FE: package.json, vercel.json, api/proxy.js, api/crawlerProxy.js.
' BE: pom.xml, docker-compose.yml, application.yml, CreatorIngestionController,
'     PaymentController, AiServiceClient, CrawlerServiceClient, CollaborationVideoStorage.
' Crawler: docker-compose.yml, main.py, celery_app.py, tasks.py, java_client.py,
'          candidate_staging.py, and the crawl, AI, review, monitor and quality routers.
' The Report 1 "Crawler Service" and "AI Service" are logical roles. This view expands
' the team-operated Python subsystem and keeps third-party providers outside the boundary.
' Brand / SME and System Admin retain their context labels. Guest, Creator and Data
' Manager are portal roles listed in the application and the accompanying requirements.
' "sync" denotes request/response. "async" denotes queued work, an event stream,
' or an independent notification. Each provider still acknowledges its HTTP request.
' Beat and FastAPI publish jobs. FastAPI also reads task results. Workers publish results.
' Spring email dispatch runs within the API process. SMTP calls are request/response.
' PayOS checkout/query and VNPay query/refund are outbound calls. Browser checkout
' and return use redirects. The inbound dependency shows server-to-server IPN/webhook.
' Media and OAuth links are conditional on the selected method and environment settings.

title UML component diagram – InfluencerMatch
!pragma layout smetana
top to bottom direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 46
skinparam ranksep 39
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #F0F5FB
  BackgroundColor<<external system>> #F7F6F2
  BorderColor #40536C
  FontColor #172B41
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #EEF6F2
  BorderColor #426455
  FontColor #172B41
}
skinparam interface {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor #40536C
  FontColor #172B41
}
skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor #40536C
  FontColor #172B41
}
skinparam ArrowColor #40536C
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12

actor "Guest, Brand / SME, Creator,\nData Manager, System Admin" as Users

package "InfluencerMatch Platform" {
  component "Web Client\nReact 19 SPA\nRenders portal and admin screens" as Web
  component "API Proxy\nVercel Functions / Node.js\nRoutes browser requests to both APIs" as Proxy
  interface "Same-origin API" as IProxy

  component "Application API\nSpring Boot 3.3 / Java 21\nApplies rules and ranks creators" as Api
  interface "Business API" as IBusiness
  interface "Creator Ingest" as IIngest
  interface "IPN" as IPaymentEvents

  component "Crawler & AI API\nFastAPI / Python\nProvides crawl and AI services" as PythonApi
  interface "Python REST" as IPython
  component "Crawler Worker\nCelery / Python\nCollects and normalizes creator data" as Worker
  component "Crawler Scheduler\nCelery Beat / Python\nSchedules recurring crawler jobs" as Beat
  component "Job Broker\nRedis 7\nQueues jobs and stores task results" as Redis <<message broker>>
  interface "Jobs & Results" as IJobs

  database "Application Database\nPostgreSQL 16 + pgvector\nStores business data and search vectors" as Pg
  interface "SQL" as ISql
  database "Crawler Staging\nSQLite\nStores candidate data before ingestion" as Staging
  interface "Staging Data" as IStaging
}

component "Identity Providers\nGoogle, Meta and TikTok Sandbox\nsign users in or authorize channels" as Identity <<external system>>
component "AI Provider\nGoogle Gemini\nExtracts brief fields and labels content" as Gemini <<external system>>
component "Payment Gateway\nVNPay and PayOS\nProcesses subscription payments" as Payment <<external system>>
component "Email Service\nSMTP relay\nDelivers OTPs and invitations" as Mail <<external system>>
component "Creator Data Providers\nTikTok, Facebook, Instagram\nExpose public profiles, posts and metrics" as Social <<external system>>
component "Media Storage\nCloudflare R2 / Cloudinary\nStores uploads and serves media" as Storage <<external system>>

interface "OAuth" as IOAuth
interface "Gemini API" as IGemini
interface "Payment API" as IPayments
interface "SMTP" as IMail
interface "Public" as IPublic
interface "Media" as IMedia

Users -down-> Web : HTTPS (sync)

Web .down.> IProxy : HTTPS / JSON (sync)\nHTTPS / SSE (async)
IProxy -down- Proxy
Proxy .down.> IBusiness : HTTPS / JSON (sync)\nHTTPS / SSE (async)
IBusiness -down- Api
Proxy .down.> IPython : HTTP / JSON (sync)\ncrawl, quality and monitoring
IPython -down- PythonApi
Api .[norank].> IPython : HTTP(S) / JSON (sync)\nidentity, metrics, AI

Api -down- IIngest
Worker .[norank].> IIngest : HTTPS / JSON (sync)\nPOST /api/v1/creators/ingest
Api .down.> ISql : JDBC / SQL (sync)
ISql -down- Pg

PythonApi .down.> IJobs : Redis / Celery (async)\nqueue jobs and read status
Worker .down.> IJobs : Redis / Celery (async)\nconsume jobs and save results
Beat .down.> IJobs : Redis / Celery (async)\npublish scheduled jobs
IJobs -down- Redis

PythonApi .[norank].> IStaging : SQLite / SQL (sync)
Worker .down.> IStaging : SQLite / SQL (sync)
IStaging -down- Staging

IOAuth -right- Identity
IGemini -right- Gemini
IPayments -right- Payment
IMail -right- Mail
IMedia -right- Storage
IPublic -right- Social

Api .[norank].> IOAuth : HTTPS (sync)\nOAuth / OIDC
Web .right.> IOAuth : HTTPS (sync)\nredirect / Google sign-in
Api .[norank].> IGemini : HTTPS / JSON (sync)\nbrief extraction
Worker .[norank].> IGemini : HTTPS / JSON (sync)\nAI enrichment
Api .[norank].> IPayments : HTTPS (sync)\ncheckout, query, refund
Api .[norank].> IMail : SMTP / TLS (sync)
Api .[norank].> IMedia : HTTPS (sync)\nS3 / Cloudinary
Web .[norank].> IMedia : HTTPS (sync)\npresigned R2

Api -down- IPaymentEvents
Payment .[norank].> IPaymentEvents : HTTPS (async)\nIPN / webhook
PythonApi .[norank].> IPublic : HTTPS (sync)
Worker .[norank].> IPublic : HTTPS (sync)

' Invisible links guide the renderer.
IPaymentEvents -[hidden]right-> ISql
IBusiness -[hidden]right-> IPython
Api -[hidden]right-> PythonApi
Worker -[hidden]right-> Beat
PythonApi -[hidden]down-> Worker
IOAuth -[hidden]down-> IPayments
IPayments -[hidden]down-> IMail
IMail -[hidden]down-> IMedia
IMedia -[hidden]down-> IGemini
IGemini -[hidden]down-> IPublic

caption Spring Boot applies business rules and ranks creators, while FastAPI and Redis-backed Celery jobs provide creator data and AI signals.
@enduml
